score":2,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"我就是经常打岔的那个。\n目标很简单，让产品少乱折腾。","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1258861,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/35/6d/07a42f81.jpg","nickname":"郑晔","note":"","ucode":"1EBD5AA5D4FC89","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":474202,"discussion_content":"事先沟通好于会上争执。","content_length":11,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1597056398,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":70171,"user_name":"Jxin","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1251111,"ip_address":"","ucode":"4C03928388C413","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/17/27/ec30d30a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1551021130,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":25031,"content":"你说得对，在正文最后，我也在说，团队规模不宜过大。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"dreamhead","uid":1258861,"ctime":1551056075,"ip_address":"","comment_id":70171,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"站会得拆，因为力度是隔天甚至每天，哪怕是只做“三言”信息同步，当项目组团队达到二十人左右时也很浪费。所以个人认为要按业务线再细分团队（一条线正常三四个人），然后顶多小组会议完后各线小组长再同步下。在需求评审时也可以按业务线分批次听，提高效率（听一早上不care的需求，真到评自己需求时其实还是发散状态的）。","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1258861,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/35/6d/07a42f81.jpg","nickname":"郑晔","note":"","ucode":"1EBD5AA5D4FC89","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":440470,"discussion_content":"你说得对，在正文最后，我也在说，团队规模不宜过大。","content_length":25,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1551056075,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":69912,"user_name":"行与修","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1241842,"ip_address":"","ucode":"11F21B663EF6D3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/f2/f2/2a9a6e9a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1550904053,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":24931,"content":"你说得很对，讲怎么开会是手段，目标实际上是沟通。这也是我把少开会做成建议的原因，我并不想教大家怎么在不好的东西上叠加，虽然我也有一些小技巧。\n\n关于你最后的问题，我们只要坚持透明沟通就可以了，如果说得不一样，就先沟通清楚了，别急着承诺什么。先说清楚，让大家的理解一致，比事后翻旧账好得多。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"dreamhead","uid":1258861,"ctime":1550973898,"ip_address":"","comment_id":69912,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"以终为始，开会是搁置分歧并执行共识，路径上就选择有效率的方式，当大家对开会只是应付而不再抱有期望是非常糟糕的。往往组织者希望营造一种民主氛围让大家能参与讨论，而现实是大多人闷头不吱声，然后组织者郁闷，并进而会在提高大家参与度上花时间，变着法子活跃会议气氛，南辕北辙～～\n之前看到文章说刘强东开会谁要是质疑就会担着被炒的风险，我觉得要是涉及多部门协调推进的话，不妨就下命令吧，只要不蛮干，可以先分头民主，再集中传达就这么干了！会议的召集人其实是有好处的，可以安排议程，可以夹私货，至于能否把控现场到时见招拆招嘛，有时候主动权的驱使更让你值得一试！\n还有个题外话也请教老师：碰到一情况，在面对面沟通时有人跟你说的和他跟其它部门hr说的不一样，如果HR不跟我互通信息就会造成我的误判，可能是什么原因？我又能做些什么消除某些无形障碍？求个指点吧😄","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1258861,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/35/6d/07a42f81.jpg","nickname":"郑晔","note":"","ucode":"1EBD5AA5D4FC89","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":440351,"discussion_content":"你说得很对，讲怎么开会是手段，目标实际上是沟通。这也是我把少开会做成建议的原因，我并不想教大家怎么在不好的东西上叠加，虽然我也有一些小技巧。\n\n关于你最后的问题，我们只要坚持透明沟通就可以了，如果说得不一样，就先沟通清楚了，别急着承诺什么。先说清楚，让大家的理解一致，比事后翻旧账好得多。","content_length":144,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1550973898,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":69777,"user_name":"彩色的沙漠","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1116183,"ip_address":"","ucode":"19A0975A5E69EA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/08/17/e63e50f3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1550839074,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":24832,"content":"这是项目经理应该考虑的问题，文章中说了，讨论会效率就会低，解决方案是先找相关人去提评审意见，而不是等到会上。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"dreamhead","uid":1258861,"ctime":1550842571,"ip_address":"","comment_id":69777,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"项目需求评审会该怎么开，往往产品经理没讲多少就会被打断，说这里那里的问题，一讨论时间过去了","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1258861,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/35/6d/07a42f81.jpg","nickname":"郑晔","note":"","ucode":"1EBD5AA5D4FC89","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":440277,"discussion_content":"这是项目经理应该考虑的问题，文章中说了，讨论会效率就会低，解决方案是先找相关人去提评审意见，而不是等到会上。","content_length":54,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1550842571,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":69647,"user_name":"Y024","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1018056,"ip_address":"","ucode":"397126D2E17997","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/88/c8/6af6d27e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1550801455,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":24882,"content":"很好的尝试！","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"dreamhead","uid":1258861,"ctime":1550896481,"ip_address":"","comment_id":69647,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"1.沟通的指导原则之一就是在同步沟通的时候（比如开会），人越少越好。而在异步沟通的时候（比如E-mail），涉及的听众越多越好。\n\n2.关于开会分享下我们正在摸索的：\n（1）每个会开始前，会议发起人在石墨文档上以“会议记录”模版（我们持续形成自己的模版）新建一个纪要：说明议程、及讨论内容等前提内容并提前告知与会人员。会议过程中在同一个石墨文档上做纪要，保证纪要可以收集全所有的笔记和行动计划。如果是关联会议，则使用上次相关的石墨文档进行追加内容（保持事件连贯性、完整性）。\n（2）半小时的会议设置为 25 分钟，一小时的会议设置成 50 分钟，留有冗余量应付需要换地方等临时情况，保证所有的会议不会有迟到的现象。","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1258861,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/35/6d/07a42f81.jpg","nickname":"郑晔","note":"","ucode":"1EBD5AA5D4FC89","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":440202,"discussion_content":"很好的尝试！","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1550896481,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":69766,"user_name":"nicklim","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1301144,"ip_address":"","ucode":"C95B0296689AD2","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1550835170,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":24826,"content":"以终为始模块的答疑，先考虑如何管理上级。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"dreamhead","uid":1258861,"ctime":1550836343,"ip_address":"","comment_id":69766,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100022301,"comment_content":"上司总是喜欢就召开会议，不出席，他就黑脸。有什么好方法吗？","like_count":3,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1258861,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/35/6d/07a42f81.jpg","nickname":"郑晔","note":"","ucode":"1EBD5AA5D4FC89","ra